  "body": "Hi, I built a fairly simple test app.  I note that when I call forget, if I try to pair again with the same device after it is forgotten, the `open()` call returns an error that the \"device is forgotten\".\r\n\r\nIf I refresh the browser the device is paired.  Is this the expected behavior, just curious.  The spec says nothing in the `open` section about what it should do if the state is \"forgotten\" https://wicg.github.io/webhid/#open-method\r\n\r\n",
